      "adaptive_causal_challenger": "AdaptiveCausalChallengerModel falls back 100% to Champion for GW1-19 and activates causal panel ML components trained on current-season GW4+ rows at GW20+.",
      "club_def_prior_challenger": "ClubDefPriorChallengerModel derives opposing-side fixture club and fits as-of club x DEF pooled xG/90 shrinkage ratio (K=360) strictly on current-season history_df (minutes > 0).",
      "def_xg_shrink_challenger": "Champion (DefXgShrinkChallengerModel) fits DEF K=2400 decayed xG/90 ratio on current-season history_df (minutes > 0) and inherits LearnedStartChallengerModel (GW >= 4, >= 500 rows ridge + assist GLM/bonus).",
